	"data": "Sub-Agent Delegation Playbook\n\nWhen to spawn, when to do it yourself, and how to write briefs that don't time out.\n\nDecision Criteria\n\nSpawn a sub-agent when:\nMulti-step research — searching, reading, and summarizing across many files\nFile editing chains — read → transform → write → verify → repeat\nIndependent parallel tasks — N unrelated things that could run simultaneously\nAnything that blocks the conversation for >2 minutes — if cithoreal is waiting, delegate\nLong tool chains — >3 sequential…",
